Package: ai-gateway-matrix
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: AI Gateway Matrix maintainers <noreply@localhost>
Depends: bash (>= 4.0), coreutils, docker.io | docker-ce, openssl | python3, jq, libgtk-3-0t64 | libgtk-3-0, libkeybinder-3.0-0, libnotify4
Recommends: docker-compose-v2 | docker-compose-plugin, fonts-noto-cjk
Suggests: python3-yaml
Homepage: https://github.com/dell121212/Private-API
Description: Appica desktop console for AI Gateway Matrix
 React and Appica based desktop control center with a native WebView shell, unified
 OpenAI-compatible endpoint, total Token history, API keys, channels, professional
 records, backend controls and jiyi persistence. An AppFlowy-based Flutter shell is
 retained as a compatibility interface.
 .
 Code: /usr/share/ai-gateway-matrix
 User data: ${XDG_CONFIG_HOME:-$HOME/.config}/ai-gateway-matrix
 No license gate. Upgrade keeps user data.
